= Hope

Ever since the abandoning of the gold standard, the UK noticeably improved on almost every metric. unemployment has fallen, and their exports are now more competitive due to the undervalued pound. In addition, inflation was not as severe as we expected, with the rest of the metrics making up for any inflation loss.

- @root: Maybe we can learn from them.

